  "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong>TreeBites Healthy Mix</strong> is a premium blend of carefully selected seeds including <strong>pumpkin seeds, sunflower seeds, flax seeds and sesame seeds</strong>. Packed as a convenient everyday seed blend, it can be added to meals, salads, cereals, smoothies, yoghurt, snacks and other recipes.<span class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p>The blend combines different seeds to provide a variety of naturally occurring nutrients. Pumpkin seeds are a source of magnesium and zinc, sunflower seeds provide vitamin E, flax seeds are naturally rich in omega-3 and fibre, while sesame seeds provide calcium and other nutrients.</p>\n<h3>Key Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Premium mixed seed blend</li>\n<li>Contains <strong>Pumpkin Seeds, Sunflower Seeds, Flax Seeds &amp; Sesame Seeds</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Plant-based source of naturally occurring nutrients</li>\n<li>Rich in dietary fibre</li>\n<li>Contains naturally occurring healthy fats and minerals</li>\n<li>Suitable for everyday meals and snacking</li>\n<li>Can be added to salads, cereals, smoothies, yoghurt and other foods</li>\n<li><strong>Net Quantity: 200 g</strong></li>\n<li><strong>MRP: ₹150</strong></li>\n</ul>",
